+### 1.6 Assembly seam (post-groken, confirmed in checkout)
+- `AssembleDataLanesInput` (`assembleDataLanes.ts:45-59`): `{kinds, clips, segmentsByAsset, extraItemsBySchemaRef?}` — `extraItemsBySchemaRef` takes **already-mapped `DataLaneItemView`s** (timeline coords) :108-115. Transcript always re-adapts from `segmentsByAsset` (:85-105). `laneId = kind.kindId | 'opaque:'+schemaRef` (:127,143); first-schemaRef-wins (:81).
+- `useDataLanes` (`useDataLanes.ts:39-137`): args `{base, kinds?, loadSegments?, extraItemsBySchemaRef?}`; per-mount `requestedRef` cache (:99) — **mounted twice**: `TimelineCanvas.tsx:317` and `PropertiesPanel.tsx:226` ⇒ two caches, two fetch sets (groken MEDIUM confirmed). Default loader = `loadTranscript` over runtime resolver (:69-77).
+- `adaptTranscript.ts`: occurrence `id = ${assetId}:${clipId}:${index}`, `sourceItemId = ${assetId}:src:${index}` (:37-38) — **positional, violates L6 #2 as-is**; `sourceArtifactRef` never populated (violates L6 #5); `entityRef` stamped when clip-scoped (:46-48).
