+`DataShape`, `DataCoordinateDomain`, `DataExtent`, `DataProvenance`, `TimelineEntityRef`, `FrozenDataItem` (with `sourceArtifactRef?: {assetId?, artifactHash?}` :55), `DataLaneRendererRef`/`DataItemInspectorRef` (`props: never` stand-ins), `DataLaneItemView`, `DataLaneView` (chrome + renderer refs mixed in — view plane), `DEFAULT_DATA_LANE_HEIGHT`, `freezeDataItem`. **No `schema_version`, no Zod, no digest anywhere** — all V2 additions.
