+- SQL tests: plain psql scripts `supabases/tests/*.test.sql` — `BEGIN; … RAISE EXCEPTION 'FAIL: …'; ROLLBACK`, seeded auth.users/projects/timelines; run via `psql "$SUPABASE_DB_URL" -f …` or `npx supabase db execute --linked --file …` (header of `timeline_events_append_rpc.test.sql`). Precedent file exists to copy.
+- Serialization helpers live in `lib/timeline-domain.ts`: `serializeTimelineConfigSnapshot` (:2488), `serializeTimelinePair` (:2512) — canonicalization precedent for the bundle module to sit beside.
